#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:35
msgid "Adding Inputs"
msgstr "Agregar entradas"

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:37
msgid ""
"Inputs are the Form options themselves and can take various forms, such "
"as text fields, checkboxes, select lists or other custom forms. Inputs "
"can be added outside of any created Field Groups or they may be added "
"within them. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD INPUT` within the desired area "
"(inside a Field Group or outside of them)."
msgstr ""
"Inputs are the Form options themselves and can take various forms, such "
"as text fields, checkboxes, select lists or other custom forms. Inputs "
"puede ser added outside of any created Field Grupos or they may be added "
"within them. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD INPUT` within the desired area "
"(inside a Field Grupo or outside of them)."

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:39
msgid ""
"When adding Inputs, you may add any Input (|LibOptInp|) that is pre-"
"existing to your form. Set \"USE EXISTING\" to \"Yes\" and make the "
"selection from the \"EXISTING OPTION TYPE\" typeahead field. Once "
"selected, you'll notice that all other settings cannot be edited. If "
"needed, edit this Input within the Inputs section (|LibOptInp|)."
msgstr ""
"When adding Inputs, you may add any Input (|LibOptInp|) that is pre-"
"existing to your form. Set \"USE EXISTING\" to \"Yes\" and make the "
"selection from the \"EXISTING OPTION TYPE\" typeahead field. Once "
"selected, you'll notice that all other settings no puede ser edited. If "
"needed, edit this Input within the Inputs section (|LibOptInp|)."

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:41
#, fuzzy
msgid ".. image:: /images/forms/existingInput.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/forms/existingInput.png"

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:43
msgid ""
"When adding Inputs, you may also create new Inputs within the Form "
"builder. Some available types are no different than other Inputs you "
"might make in the Input section (|LibOptInp|) but other types are unique "
"to Forms. To create a new Input, set \"USE EXISTING\" to \"No\" and "
"select the desired type."
msgstr ""
"Cuando adding Inputs, you may also create new Inputs within the Form "
"builder. Some available types are no different than other Inputs you "
"might make in the Input section (|LibOptInp|) but other types are unique "
"to Forms. To create a new Input, set \"USE EXISTING\" to \"No\" and "
"select the desired type."

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:45
msgid ""
"Input types are organized by categories. Inputs in the basic category are"
" primarily the same types of Inputs that can be made in the Inputs "
"section (|LibOptInp|). These include text fields, select lists, checkbox "
"arrays, numerical inputs, and more. You can read more about the basic "
"Input types in |morpheus| `Input documentation "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/library/options/options.html#inputs>`_."
msgstr ""
"Input types are organized by categories. Inputs in the basic category are"
" primarily the same types of Inputs that puede ser made in the Inputs "
"section (|LibOptInp|). These include text fields, select lists, checkbox "
"arrays, numerical inputs, and more. You can read more about the basic "
"Input types in |morpheus| `Input documentation "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/library/options/options.html#inputs>`_."

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:47
msgid ""
"Inputs in the Advanced and Provisioning categories are unique to Forms "
"and require additional explanation. Advanced inputs are similar to basic "
"but provide some sort of data manipulation capability or have a specific "
"targeted function. See the list of advanced Input types below:"
msgstr ""
"Inputs en el/la Advanced y Provisioning categories son unique a Forms y "
"require additional explanation. Advanced inputs son similar a basic but "
"provide algunos/algunas sort de data manipulation capability o tienen "
"un/una específico/específica targeted function. See el/la list de "
"advanced Input types below:"

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Byte Size:** Allows numerical disk or storage size values to be given "
"with selectable units (MB, GB, etc.). When a value is input and the unit "
"is changed, the same value will be automatically computed into the new "
"unit amount (1 GB > 1024 MB, for example). Users may select which unit is"
" initially loaded by default."
msgstr ""
"**Byte Size:** Allows numerical disk o storage size values a be given con"
" selectable units (MB, GB, etc.). Cuando un/una value es input y el/la "
"unit es changed, el/la mismo/misma value será/n be automatically computed"
" en el/la nuevo/nueva unit amount (1 GB > 1024 MB, para example). "
"Usuarios puede/n select el/la cual unit es initially loaded por default."

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Code Editor:** Gives the user a code editor field. Set a language or "
"markdown format in the \"HIGHLIGHTING\" field to enable automatic syntax "
"highlighting and spacing for the user. For example, the user could enter "
"a provisioning shell script for their workload or provide a custom JSON "
"payload at provision time (complete with syntax highlighting for easy "
"entry)."
msgstr ""
"**Code Editor:** Gives el/la user un/una code editor field. Set un/una "
"language o markdown format en el/la \"HIGHLIGHTING\" field a enable "
"automatic syntax highlighting y spacing para el/la user. For example, "
"el/la user could enter un/una provisioning shell script para their "
"workload o provide un/una custom JSON payload en provision time (complete"
" con syntax highlighting para easy entry)."

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:51
msgid ""
"**File Content:** Access file content either locally entered or sourced "
"from an integrated repository or outside URL"
msgstr ""
"**File Content:** Access file content either locally entered or sourced "
"from an integrated repository or outside URL"

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Icon Picker:** Allows the user to select an icon for their workload at "
"provision time. The user may select from previously uploaded icons, "
"upload their own, or use the built-in icon generator tool to create a "
"unique icon right in the Form"
msgstr ""
"**Icon Picker:** Allows el/la user a select un/una icon para their "
"workload en provision time. El/La user puede/n select desde previously "
"uploaded icons, upload their own, o use el/la built-in icon generator "
"tool a create un/una unique icon right en el/la Form"

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Key Value:** Allows the user to enter as many key/value pairs as they'd"
" like which can be onboarded into the workload config at provision time"
msgstr ""
"**Key Value:** Allows the user to enter as many key/value pairs as they'd"
" like which puede ser onboarded into the workload config at provision "
"time"

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Text Array:** Allows the user to enter multiple values separated by a "
"delimiter of your choosing. |morpheus| will parse out the entered values "
"which can be individually deleted if desired before the form is submitted"
msgstr ""
"**Text Array:** Allows the user to enter multiple values separated by a "
"delimiter of your choosing. |morpheus| will parse out the entered values "
"which puede ser individually deleted if desired before the form is "
"submitted"

#: ../../library/options/forms.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Typeahead:** Similar to Select List, especially for very long lists. "
"Search for the desired value by typing the first few letters as a search "
"parameter. Users may also browse the complete list by clicking the "
"dropdown icon. This Input type can also support multiple selections, if "
"needed. Associate this type of Input with a pre-defined Option List or "
"create a new Option List right inside the Form builder"
msgstr ""
"**Typeahead:** Similar a Select List, especially para very long lists. "
"Search para el/la desired value por typing el/la primer/primera few "
"letters como un/una search parameter. Usuarios puede/n también browse "
"el/la complete list por clicking el/la dropdown icon. Este/Esta Input "
"type puede/n también support multiple selections, si needed. Associate "
"este/esta type de Input con un/una pre-defined Lista de opciones o create"
" un/una nuevo/nueva Lista de opciones right inside el/la Form builder"

